{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e9fd500ffeede290fcf3c7a94400070ba91e349b882b191c9c3c6db102960fb9", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影日。\nエレナはカフェで働く姿を撮影する……）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄日。\n要拍摄艾蕾娜在咖啡馆工作的样子……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "a0df465996f738c424f118a185d203065f49a87b2227f17388c36677821ccc44", "ja": "えーっと……ケーキセットがふたつ。お飲み物は\nコーヒーがふたつで、いい……よろしい、デスカ？", "zh": "那个……两份蛋糕套餐。饮料是两杯咖啡，这样……可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1002_p", "source_sha256": "461ae3e612730594a7491acd25fa8ca0267d7c430e44b3c56c21e1567b1192c7", "ja": "（あれ？　リハーサルは普通の喋り方だったのに……。\nなんで敬語に？　うーん、あとで聞いてみるか……）", "zh": "（咦？彩排时明明说话还很正常……\n怎么突然用起敬语了？嗯——之后问问她吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1003_null", "source_sha256": "a1269628ae1a31b7c3027a5c36e0f5ec7f2b4dcc51bd33ce7866202fe4c2df78", "ja": "休憩中……", "zh": "休息中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "18f1c9a60c779e24fa96bf708f848fd5a24baa4eb641fab870c6ad4bdad58477", "ja": "ふぃー……。\nケイゴって、大変なノ……。はあ～……。", "zh": "呼……敬语真难啊……唉～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1005_p", "source_sha256": "f8ea3112082fb7fe06139060d9b9c62587d23311507f237a539c54f3ab741705", "ja": "エレナ、お疲れさま。よく頑張ってたな。\nちょっと聞きたいんだけど。どうして敬語にしたんだ？", "zh": "艾丽娜，辛苦了。你刚才表现得很努力。\n我有点想问问……你为什么突然用敬语了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "d5d3d0be8f7eb03f12a90f01375da0e256c07e07f37f387d5d08a1ebdfffbfaa", "ja": "えっ？　どうしてって……ここで働いてる人たちは、\nみんなケイゴを使ってるデショ？", "zh": "诶？问我为什么……因为在这里工作的人，大家都在用敬语，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "9e91a0edabe42b83539cc95596547a6cfb3cd3e1f0be7566add955c39ebe1fcc", "ja": "それにね、前にエミリーと話してたんだヨ！\n日本の『オモテナシ』ってカッコイイねって！", "zh": "而且啊，我之前还和艾米莉聊过！\n我们还说，日本的“待客之道”很酷呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9a20181e983c974ce489e800f00f15473cd8d147d9cfc9c84da09d7664a7bed6", "ja": "それで敬語を？", "zh": "所以就开始说敬语了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "95240298ce7532b2c3089a2bad6ebe045f5e53d7d23cfb8c379931fcac1928dd", "ja": "うん。心を込めたオモテナシで、みんなハッピー！\n……って思ったんだケド。すぐにはできないネ……。", "zh": "嗯。本来觉得用诚心诚意的款待，就能让大家超开心！\n……可是，果然没办法一下子就做到呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1010_p", "source_sha256": "83c8816a8f8813cd1b3b5178038aee95f38893d3b4b3d9e7661038d85610a791", "ja": "そういうことだったのか……。たしかに、敬語は\nお客さんに丁寧に接する気持ちの表れだけど……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……敬语确实是\n以礼貌态度接待客人的心意体现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1011_p", "source_sha256": "36d9f13d13f99b3f2645dc8d3853aa2995e965609e06acbd435445db99915978", "ja": "なあ、エレナ。接客してる時、\nお客さんがどんな様子だったか覚えてるか？", "zh": "喂，艾莲娜。你还记得接待客人时，客人是什么样子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "55abb3a778f45624dff9d8a3f4657de05083efbfec68d88fdccf622774d3be5b", "ja": "え？　……あ、あれ？　そういえば、\nどんな顔してたか覚えてないカモ……。", "zh": "诶？……啊，咦？这么说来，我好像不记得他们当时是什么表情了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1013_p", "source_sha256": "cc2714e31ac388291f12149cc48a4e775c7b8e5dca730e843e015bb2f1710067", "ja": "やっぱり、そうだったか……。なら次は、お客さんの\nことを考えて、エレナのおもてなしをしてみないか？", "zh": "果然是这样啊……。那么接下来，要不要考虑一下客人，试着用艾蕾娜的方式招待他们？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "c13e6237427e3df1181f8a6ffbf0b53e3a40c7a79ba13e40b3f6eb11fd535b8b", "ja": "ワタシのオモテナシ……。\nうん。{$P$}、ワタシやってみるネ！", "zh": "我的待客之道……  \n嗯。{$P$}，我来试试看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1015_se", "source_sha256": "e7e41f6fb8d623dc1e48bbb3970ef3777f0efd47258a41c703d156aab9135892", "ja": "カランカラン", "zh": "框啷框啷", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "1b82c45023bdeff242e7fb4f16fe8a7904730446380fa0ddbf28f5594b2c0d79", "ja": "いらっしゃいませー！　えっと……何名様、デスカ？\n……わかったヨ！　それじゃお席にご案内するネ♪", "zh": "欢迎光临——！呃……请问几位？\n\n……知道啦！那我带您去座位哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0393_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0393_1017_p", "source_sha256": "65cb7346aa00627a9bec76c38b649ef72a5d52a7833caf942f18470a0f6043a6", "ja": "（エレナの『オモテナシ』は大成功！　お客さんも\nエレナも、みんな笑顔で、いい写真になった！）", "zh": "（艾蕾娜的“款待”大获成功！客人和艾蕾娜都面带笑容，拍出了很棒的照片！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
